H4 -- intact channel vs shuffled, 10 min, 12 matched seeds (36-47), 16 hens
NO PLASTICITY in any condition. Hawk every 20 s.

intake and risk are a trade-off, not a score: a flock that never forages
is safe and starving. Read the two columns together.

