--- HEADLINE: L  language vs C? yoked ---
The registered contrast (backlog section 1), not L vs deaf. Identical brain,
identical bandwidth, identical calling cost. The only difference is whether
what she hears is about her own surroundings.

  caught/dive     -0.029 +/- 0.020 SE   suggestive (t=1.42, need 2.20)   (lower is better for L)
  fed %           +0.053 +/- 0.087 SE   noise (t=0.61)   (higher is better for L)
  caught/event*   -0.142 +/- 0.061 SE   SIGNIFICANT   (lower is better for L)
  caught rate*    -0.119 +/- 0.059 SE   suggestive (t=2.02, need 2.20)   (lower is better for L)
  struck/hen    -209.432 +/- 202.968 SE   suggestive (t=1.03, need 2.20)   (lower is better for L)
  hunger          -0.003 +/- 0.003 SE   suggestive (t=1.16, need 2.20)   (lower is better for L)
  * confounded denominators, see the check above. Reported, not relied on.

  pooled over events, for comparison with the paired means above:
    caught/dive   L  language 0.084   C? yoked 0.112   diff -0.028
    caught/event  L  language 0.299   C? yoked 0.371   diff -0.071
    caught|blind  L  language 0.506   C? yoked 0.577   diff -0.071

--- T1's registered metric: food intake at matched risk ---
  fed % +0.053 +/- 0.087 SE   noise (t=0.61)
  backlog section 3 predicted L forages MORE than C? at equal risk.
  In E026 this was 3.06 vs 3.07 and then 2.54 vs 2.41 -- null, and worse in
  the replication. Reported here whatever it says.

--- The falsifiers H4 named in advance ---
  L vs C- (capacity)     caught/dive  -0.032 +/- 0.015 SE  suggestive (t=2.18, need 2.20)
                         if ~0, the extra neurons did the work, not the channel
  L vs Cs (self-only)    caught/dive  -0.027 +/- 0.013 SE  suggestive (t=2.00, need 2.20)
                         if ~0, the channel is private memory, not communication
  L vs C0 (severed)      caught/dive  -0.032 +/- 0.015 SE  suggestive (t=2.18, need 2.20)
                         if ~0, hearing nothing costs nothing -- no information was flowing
  L vs N (natural)       caught/dive  -0.051 +/- 0.012 SE  SIGNIFICANT
                         does the language flock beat a naturalistic bird, or a lobotomised one?
  L vs Lx (lesioned)     caught/dive  +0.006 +/- 0.013 SE  noise (t=0.47)
                         if ~0, the pallium is not in the causal path and this is a result about the reflex arc

  NOTE on C-: with plasticity off in every condition, the capacity control
  is vacuous by construction -- an untrained pallium is a random projection
  that cannot use extra neurons. H0's 'at any capacity' clause is untested
  until a learning rule works. Kept in the ladder so it is not re-dropped.

manipulation check: 'alarm heard' must be ~0 for C- and C0, and non-zero elsewhere.
